WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
Every drawer has something we stopped noticing.

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:08.480
An umbrella. A kettle. A lamp that still remembers the late nights.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.080
Afterlife Bureau gives forgotten objects a voice.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:19.040
Take a photo, add a memory, and meet an original spirit inspired by Japanese object folklore.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:25.520
Then turn that feeling into a second chance: repair it, reuse it, or pass it on.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:29.600
The character is invented. The next step is real.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.160
Afterlife Bureau. A little forgotten. A lot of soul.
